SUMMARY:Something Rotten 🍅🎵
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack\n"Something Rotten" tells the story of 
 two brothers\, Nick & Nigel\, who are determined to write a hit play\, but
  constantly find themselves in the shadow of Shakespeare. Following the pr
 edictions of a soothsayer\, they instead change their focus to write the f
 irst ever musical with hilarious results!\n\nWe will meet inside for intro
 ductions prior to show start. I will be sitting in E101 and tickets can be
  purchased at link below. Please be sure to selectthe Scrambled cast and M
 ay 9th 7:30 showing:\n\nhttps://ci.ovationtix.com/35211/pr/1271798/pe/1179
 3047
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-marin-brat-pack/events/3145826
 81/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260501T183735Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260501T183735Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
