SUMMARY:Fuel + Gas Money @ Wednesday Night Market (SR)
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack\nKick off the 2026 Wednesday Night Mark
 et with Fuel and Gas Money!\n\nBring a blanket or a chair for the grass an
 d some food and drinks if you would like. There will be plenty of vendors 
 out if you want to grab something here.\n\nShould be a great show!
