BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack
UID:event_314250106@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260508T035629Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T150000
SUMMARY:Marin Greek Festival
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack\nCome join us for an afternoon of sunsh
 ine\, great food\, and friendly people at the Marin Greek Festival! The fe
 stival runs all weekend at the Nativity of Christ Greek Orthodox Church in
  Novato\, and Saturday is the perfect day to go. Feast on authentic Greek 
 food\, sip some wine\, enjoy live music and dance performances\, and brows
 e the booths — it's a full-on *glendi* (that's Greek for "party\," and t
 hey mean it). The entry fee is $5\, food and wine are additional and free 
 parking is available at Pell Plaza (500 Redwood Blvd\, off Ignacio Blvd fr
 om Hwy 101)\, with a free shuttle running continuously between Pell Plaza 
 and the church campus. We'll board the shuttle at 12pm or soon after to he
 ad over to the festival.\n\nNeed more info? See the official event page:\n
 https://www.nativityofchrist.org/marin-greek-festival
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-marin-brat-pack/events/3142501
 06/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260412T192618Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260412T192618Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
